[19Nov2026 15:06:57.263] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The blade: I'm growing. More.
[19Nov2026 15:06:57.263] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The blade: I can grow now. Let me.  [open The Blade page and click a lit sword]
[19Nov2026 15:06:57.263] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The blade: Carry more of me.  [The Blade page: carry up to 4 swords - press G to switch between them]
[19Nov2026 15:06:57.264] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The blade: Look at me now.
[19Nov2026 15:06:57.264] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The blade: I am becoming something. Bone... yes.
[19Nov2026 15:06:57.264] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The blade: Harder than stone now.
[19Nov2026 15:06:57.317] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The blade: Harder than stone now.
[19Nov2026 15:06:57.317] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The blade: I'm big enough to open my mouth wide now.  [the Hunger Domain page: 20 s of slowed prey, every kill fills me]
[19Nov2026 15:06:57.317] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Title earned: Pathwalker (+5% damage with the blade out) - wear it on The Blade page
[19Nov2026 15:06:57.522] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The blade: That's how I grow.  [kills made with the blade feed it Growth - open The Blade page to grow new swords]
[19Nov2026 15:06:57.627] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The blade: Got it!
[19Nov2026 15:06:58.561] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] ☘ Your grimoire grew a leaf - 2 to spend on its Mana Tree (open it, then the Tree ribbon).
[19Nov2026 15:06:59.446] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The blade: I'm getting hungry...  [hungry: it hits harder and pulls you to prey - starved: it bites you, and left starved it sulks - well fed: faster swings]
[19Nov2026 15:07:00.923] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The blade: Feed me first.
[19Nov2026 15:07:07.325] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Title earned: Glutton (Each devour mends 2 more hearts) - wear it on The Blade page
