[19Nov2026 15:09:55.362] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Ossuarch: Another one wanders into my ossuary. Stay - you'll fit right in.
[19Nov2026 15:10:06.467] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Ossuarch: You can scratch bone. Fine - let's see you cut through space.
[19Nov2026 15:10:22.739] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Ossuarch: Enough. I'll show you what was waiting under the bone.
[19Nov2026 15:10:32.773] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Ossuarch: ...Then we end this together.
[19Nov2026 15:10:33.971] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] A TORN MEMORY PAGE  drifts down from The Ossuarch - Chapter I, page 1. Use it to read it into your grimoire.
[19Nov2026 15:10:34.025] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Ossuarch: ...So the bone remembers you. Hm.
[19Nov2026 15:10:35.312] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Beast of Despair: Hope? I'll tear it out of you. Despair is the only thing that's real.
[19Nov2026 15:10:50.214] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Beast of Despair: You made me open it... Now see what a real beast looks like.
[19Nov2026 15:11:07.743] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Beast of Despair: Struggle all you want. Everything gets swallowed by despair in the end.
[19Nov2026 15:11:12.782] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Beast of Despair: If I'm going down, I'm taking every one of you with me!
[19Nov2026 15:11:13.992] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] A TORN MEMORY PAGE  drifts down from The Beast of Despair - Chapter I, page 2. Use it to read it into your grimoire.
[19Nov2026 15:11:14.044] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Beast of Despair: Hope... is only... a longer road to despair...
[19Nov2026 15:11:15.330] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Rhya: Ugh, more work... Fine. Let me see that grimoire of yours - I'll be borrowing it.
[19Nov2026 15:11:26.468] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Rhya: Alright, alright... you know I've touched a lot of grimoires, right? Captains' ones, even.
[19Nov2026 15:11:37.735] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Rhya: Fine. Then I'll copy the one magic that isn't supposed to be copied.
[19Nov2026 15:11:42.337] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Rhya: Total Copy. Everything I've touched today - all of it, at once.
[19Nov2026 15:11:42.794] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Rhya: Heh... I'm so tired... Wake me when it's over...
[19Nov2026 15:11:55.345] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Licht: You carry a grimoire... Then show me what you would protect with it.
[19Nov2026 15:12:07.737] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Licht: Not bad. This one is heavier.
[19Nov2026 15:12:21.467] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Licht: Two blades now. Keep up.
[19Nov2026 15:12:33.968] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Licht: ...Forgive me. What comes next is not light.
[19Nov2026 15:12:35.322] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Revenant: Welcome, welcome. My friends here have been dying to meet you.
[19Nov2026 15:12:50.224] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Revenant: You think you can close them all? I'll just open more!
[19Nov2026 15:13:02.737] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] A TORN MEMORY PAGE  drifts down from The Revenant - Chapter I, page 3. Use it to read it into your grimoire.
[19Nov2026 15:13:02.791] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Revenant: No... not like this... not before I get my revenge...
[19Nov2026 15:13:15.321] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Curse Witch: Heehoehoehoe! A visitor in the forest? Stay, stay - let me curse you properly!
[19Nov2026 15:13:30.212] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Curse Witch: Oh-ho! You're a tough one! Then my little ones will help - heehoehoe!
[19Nov2026 15:13:37.790] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Curse Witch: Heehoe... hoe... my curses... they're lifting...
[19Nov2026 15:14:15.235] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Cinder Sovereign: You think fire fears the rain? Burn.
[19Nov2026 15:14:35.215] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Cinder Sovereign: ENOUGH. The world beneath you is mine.
[19Nov2026 15:14:36.258] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Copyist's Echo: She wrote me to keep the books. You want her pages? Read them off me.
[19Nov2026 15:14:45.207] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Copyist's Echo: You're tearing me. That's how she made me - from torn pages.
[19Nov2026 15:14:52.709] [Server thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.world.entity.LivingEntity/]: Named entity MemoryGuardian['The Copyist's Echo'/2401, l='ServerLevel[isg_uishots_1795098512781]', x=-0.22, y=-60.00, z=-7.77] died: The Copyist's Echo was slain by Tester
[19Nov2026 15:14:52.742] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] MEMORY RECOVERED  The Copyist's Echo fades into a last page. +15 merit stars.
[19Nov2026 15:14:52.742] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT]   Chapter II begins: its pages are with the great foes again.
[19Nov2026 15:14:52.789] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.advancements.AdvancementList/]: Loaded 50 advancements
[19Nov2026 15:14:52.789] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Copyist's Echo: ...Keep the books. Better than I did.
[19Nov2026 15:15:15.323] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Dante: Cut me, burn me, break me. I'll simply put myself back together.
[19Nov2026 15:15:30.726] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Dante: Hold still. This only takes a moment.
[19Nov2026 15:15:33.593] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Dante: ...My mana. Gone? No - not yet!
[19Nov2026 15:15:40.239] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Dante: You've seen what my body can do. Now feel how heavy the world can be.
[19Nov2026 15:15:44.088] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Dante: There. Whole again.
[19Nov2026 15:15:54.573] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Dante: ...My mana. Gone? No - not yet!
